## Why This Is Asked
Offline-first media uploads are common in field apps; handling multiple files with reliability and backpressure is a real pain point. This tests bridge design, background work, and robust queueing.

## Key Concepts
- TurboModules/JSI bridging in React Native
- Background work on Android (WorkManager) and iOS (BGTaskScheduler)
- Durable local queue with per-file state
- Chunked uploads, backpressure, retries, and backoff strategies
- Security and privacy for stored media

